	(text "Placed four times: axes 0 to 3.\nRS-422 STEP/DIR (5 V), ENA open drain to 0 V, ALM through an optocoupler fed by +VIN_OUT.\nWiring of a drive: COM+ of its inputs on +VIN_OUT (pin 7), servo-on on ENA (pin 4),\nits floating alarm output between ALM (pin 5) and 0 V (pin 8)."
